' 来源：《详细设计说明书》1.1.2 之「2. 单词学习模块功能点」
@startuml 单词学习模块用例图
title 单词学习模块用例图

left to right direction

actor 普通用户 as user

rectangle "单词学习模块" {
  usecase "学习模式答题" as UC1
  usecase "复习模式答题" as UC2
  usecase "标记为不熟练" as UC3
  usecase "自定义词库管理" as UC4
  usecase "查看自定义单词" as UC41
  usecase "CSV 导入单词" as UC42
  usecase "删除自定义单词" as UC43
}

user --> UC1
user --> UC2
user --> UC3
user --> UC4

UC4 ..> UC41 : <<include>>
UC4 ..> UC42 : <<include>>
UC4 ..> UC43 : <<include>>

note bottom of UC1
  取词来源：status=learning 的单词池
end note
note bottom of UC2
  取词来源：status=mastered 的单词池；
  答错使熟练度低于阈值时回退 learning
end note
note bottom of UC3
  proficiency=0，status=learning，
  该词重新进入学习池
end note
note bottom of UC42
  CSV 格式：english,chinese[,part_of_speech]，
  UTF-8 编码，每行一条
end note
@enduml
